  "notes_before": [
    "Note. Values are mean (SD) or n (%) on an available-data basis (per-variable N: 2,785–3,197 retained; 1,518–1,757 2011-only). Standardised differences are the mean difference divided by the pooled SD (continuous) or the proportion difference divided by sqrt(p(1−p)) (binary); absolute values > 0.1 indicate meaningful imbalance. Cohort exclusion counts at each step are in Supplementary Table S4. BMI summaries exclude values outside the plausible range of 12–60 kg m⁻²."
